TI  - Therapeutic potential of Cola nitida against dexamethasone- and scopolamine-induced cognitive and cardiac dysfunction.
AU  - Adedayo Lawrence Dayo
AU  - Michael Olugbenga S
AU  - Ayilara Gideon Opeyemi
AU  - Olumoroti Mayode Elizabeth
AU  - Bamidele Olubayode
AU  - Samaila Saminu
