TI  - Title: Gene expression, neuroinflammation, and neural plasticity in type 2 diabetes: Translational insights from exercise and cognitive modulation.
AU  - Diniz Cristovam Guerreiro
AU  - Bento-Torres Natáli Valim Oliver
AU  - da Costa Emanuel Ramos
AU  - Morais Magalhães Nara Gyzely de
AU  - Melo Mauro André Damasceno de
