TI  - Angiogenic T cells and cognitive function in older adults with type 2 diabetes treated with GLP-1 receptor agonists.
AU  - Longo Miriam
AU  - Caruso Paola
AU  - Auriemma Maria Chiara
AU  - Maio Antonietta
AU  - Di Meo Irene
AU  - Scappaticcio Lorenzo
AU  - Maiorino Maria Ida
