ID  - 41766347
TI  - A Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis of Semaglutide Effects on Adipose Tissue and Emerging Effects on Brain and Cognition.
AU  - Saghazadeh Amene
AU  - Dolatshahi Mahsa
AU  - Mohammadi Soheil
